  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_Pixelmon_header.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"549\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">此資源包是為「Immersive Pixelmon」整合包所設計！雖然您當然可以將其加入遊戲中，但它會新增寶可夢的讀取畫面。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要以下模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loading-backgrounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loading Backgrounds</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>是否需要伺服器與朋友一起遊玩？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds/BH_LB_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在尋找能與朋友一起玩任何模組或整合包的伺服器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 就是您的最佳選擇！他們提供最具性價比的 Minecraft 伺服器，且如果點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>，使用代碼 \"Lupin\" 即可享有 25% 折扣。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds/BH_LB_banner1.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>它能在伺服器上運作嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然！它能完美運作！請記住，使用模組與朋友同樂的最佳方式是透過 BisectHosting，且透過<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此連結即可獲得 25% 折扣</a></strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此資源包可用於整合包中嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然！只要僅發布在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上即可。上傳至任何其他平台都將侵犯我們的權益，且完全不允許。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，如果您考慮將其加入您的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 整合包中，我們將深感感激。若您需要任何調整或有其他問題，歡迎聯繫我們！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以錄製此模組的影片並在頻道中展示嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然，您可以在您的頻道中自由遊玩此模組或我們的任何整合包並製作相關影片，事實上，我們會非常感謝您！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_Pixelmon_screenshot1.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_Pixelmon_screenshot2.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_Pixelmon_screenshot3.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_Pixelmon_screenshot4.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></p>",
